*~

# Local state: never commit anything that identifies an account or a machine.
# accounts.tsv maps account UUIDs to e-mail addresses and lives in
# ~/.claude-profiles; a stray copy here would leak real addresses.
accounts.tsv
*.local
.env
.env.*

# Logs, backups, generated launchers and profile data
*.log
logs/
backups/
profiles/
.claude-profiles/
*.plist
*.app/
